### List events
GET http://localhost:5000/api/events?page=1&limit=10

### Search events
GET http://localhost:5000/api/events?q=Monsoon

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/events/events-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Last Ticket Event",
  "category": "Navratri",
  "city": "Surat",
  "date": "2026-12-08",
  "price": 249
}
